OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to cut parking fees not
OL,4,Aenough - councillors
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuth Phillips, co-owner of Bishopthorpe
OL,7,FRoad's Good Food Shop, said the cuts
OL,8,Fwould not provide enough support to
OL,9,Fpeople struggling amid difficult
OL,10,Feconomic times.
